ede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair, and in 2025 it hit just 34% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 28922 at 40%. The preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 28923 sits at 155.6, and that figure can still change.</p>"}
